space-groups and agent-groups

These mods are adapted from the built-in spaces and agents mods in Herdr 0.1.16.
Upstream: https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app
Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0.

The space-groups adaptation adds name-prefix groups, local fold state,
collapsed-group status and selection, group-scoped worktree nesting, and
drag and drop. The agent-groups adaptation adds per-machine name-prefix
groups, short space labels, local fold state, and an attention indicator.
See LICENSE for the license text.
